  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your tibia is fractured. The leg is still reasonably straight thanks to an intact fibula (the other thinner long bone in your lower leg) but any weight put upon it leads to excruciating pain as the broken bone ends grind against each other. Shards of bone poke out of the skin. Nasty!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> You gain Prone, @Condition[Stunned] (2) and @Condition[Bleeding] (1), also suffering a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.2iult41Jehz0F1O8]{Broken Bone (Major)} and contracting a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.kKccDTGzWzSXCBOb]{Festering Wound} due to the open fracture.</p>"
    },
